OL,3,GNEWSAAuthority could hire event        
OL,4,Amanagers for state visits              
OL,6,FThe council said in February it would  
OL,7,Fhave been unable to support future     
OL,8,Fstate visits had its costs not been    
OL,9,Freimbursed. The government later       
OL,10,Fconfirmed they had been paid.          
